          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पूर्तता करणे — pūrtatā karṇe — \"to fulfil (a condition)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सगळ्या अटींची पूर्तता केल्यास प्रवेश मिळेल. sagaḷyā aṭīñcī pūrtatā kelyās praveś miḷel. If all the conditions are fulfilled, you will get admission."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पूर्तता केली, tyāne pūrtatā kelī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is fulfilled takes -ची: अटींची पूर्तता."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पूर्तता करणे (pūrtatā karṇe) joins पूर्तता, a learned noun built on Sanskrit pūrti, \"filling, completion\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
